This directory holds the General MIDI soundbank the browser example plays
through. It is expected to exist; its contents are not tracked.

Expected:

  SGM.sf2      any General MIDI .sf2 soundbank, placed here by hand

Not tracked because the file is ~310 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB blob limit, so
it cannot be pushed at all. Download a GM soundbank and drop it in under this
name, or point the tools at whatever name you use.

The sample sets in ../magenta-sf are rendered from this file by
src/tools/generate-magenta-sound-font.js.
